    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐτῠο-κάμπη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a stinging</i> or
				<i>urticating caterpillar of the pinewoods</i>, prob. the
				<i>processional caterpillar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zopyr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				14.58.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.756
			</span></i> :—also written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐτῠο-κάμπτης</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεροκέλαδοι</span>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>small pine-cone</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.868
			</span></i>.</div>
